    "title": "Augusta to pay $700K to family of man killed in crash involving sheriff's deputy - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By William Rioux ,\n6 hours ago WAYNESBORO, Ga. (WRDW/WAGT) - The city of Augusta will pay $700,000 to the family of a man killed in 2023 when a Richmond County Sheriff’s Office vehicle struck his car at Highway 25 and Cohen Road. Deputy Ty Dailey was behind the wheel at the time of the crash.... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
